## Commits
### 43a9b55
Name the classic 5h's own reset while the 7d is used up

### d3529ac
Skip the clock tests a passing minute could break and narrow the reset once

### af55e5c
Count the limit explanations forward and name the reset by its clock time

Each limit tag's explanation reads '<badge> at <N>%: <sentence>' in one function, limitWords. It counts a run-out from now and names the reset by its local clock time, formatted with Date methods and no Intl. A run-out already due reads 'runs out any moment', a reading at 100% included, and a reset in the past counts as none. The 5h paused behind a used-up 7d names the 7d's reset.


